== Mechanics ==
{{see|Buried Treasure (object)}}
* Using the item will grant the [[special action key]] {{skill icon|Scan (Treasure Hunting Kit)}}
** Lasts for 20 minutes after usage.
* This skill will mark an area on your map with a blue circle, which will contain a [[Buried Treasure (object)|Buried Treasure]].
* Using the skill again will show a colored orb moving in the direction of the chest. Red = far, Yellow = closer, Green = very close.
* You can reset the location the kit gives you by logging out to the [[character selection screen]], then logging back again. This is useful during the 20 minutes event when the kit would make you waste time by navigating an area full of enemies.

