== Notes ==
* Cannot be used in [[raid]]s.
* Chests can only be found in the base maps of ''[[Path of Fire]]'': [[Crystal Oasis]], [[Desert Highlands]], [[Elon Riverlands]], [[The Desolation]], [[Domain of Vabbi]]
* When used in an invalid map. it shows: {{red|Item can only be used in the Crystal Desert.}}
{{anomaly|Using the item in other [[Crystal Desert]] maps still shows the same message.}}

